        "",
        "The dashboard does too much. It",
        "opens with nine cards and only",
        "three are read. People scroll past",
        "the rest to reach the search box.",
        "",
        "Search is the real front door.",
        "Every session in the recording",
        "started the same way: ignore the",
        "cards, type a name, open one",
        "account.",
        "",
        "So: lead with search.",
        "",
        "Move the three read cards under",
        "it, drop the rest behind a link.",
        "Nobody asked for the sparklines",
        "and nobody looked at them.",
        "",
        "Second thing. The export button",
        "sits at the bottom of a long page",
        "and is missed. Two people asked",
        "for a feature that already exists.",
        "",
        "Put it beside search.",
        "",
        "Open question: do we keep the",
        "weekly mail? It has a good open",
        "rate but no clicks at all, which",
